I now have a new metro card.
I need to travel by this metro.
I go near the gate.
I tap the card on the machine.
The glass doors open.
I go inside.
There is an escalator ahead.
I go up by the escalator.
I reach the platform.
There is a yellow line on the floor there.
I stand behind the yellow line.
After a short while, a sleek train arrives.
The train stops at the platform.
The train's doors open automatically.
First, some passengers alight from the train.
Then I board the train.
The metro carriage is air-conditioned.
It feels very cool inside.
The train's doors close again.
